Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:49.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《机械战警》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新闻追击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Media Break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.72,0:01:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们三分钟 我们会为你带来世界的大事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give us three minutes and we'll give you the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家早 我是卡西黄 她是帕金斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. I'm Casey Wong with Jesse Perkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要新闻 比勒陀利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top story, Pretoria.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天南非的核子冲突威胁升级{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The threat of nuclear confrontation in South Africa escalated today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个被占领的首都军人政府…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the ruling white military government.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,展示一枚法国制造的中子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of that besieged city-state unveiled a French-made neutron bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,并表示会使用它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and affirmed its willingness to use the three megaton device.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为该市的最后防线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the city's last line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统在星球大战的和平平台上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the President's first press conference from the Star Wars orbiting peace platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,举行的首个记者招待会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}got off to a shaky start,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为电源中断而出师不利 导致总统和他的随从{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when power failed causing a brief, but harmless, period of weightlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现无序状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the visiting President and his staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们稍后会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要做大手术了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it time for that big operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这或许是你一生中最重要的决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may be the most important decision of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来和我们经验丰富的外科医生谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So come down and talk to one of our qualified surgeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在家庭心脏中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}here at the Family Heart Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有延森雅马哈制造的各种心脏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We feature the complete Jarvik line, series 7 Sports Heart by Jensen, Yamaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.45,0:02:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请购买我们生产的心脏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pick the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,物美价廉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extended warranties, financing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.75,0:02:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供请即查询{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qualifies for health tax credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,记着 我们关怀你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember, we care.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,三名警员死亡 一名重伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three dead police officers, one critically injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.59,0:02:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方高层指责普及消费者产品公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police union leaders blame Omni Consumer Products, OCP,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,OCP最近跟市政府达成协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the firm which recently entered into a contract with the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.81,0:02:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,经营及管理底特律市警务处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fund and run the Detroit Metropolitan Police Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,OCP总裁迪克·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Jones, Division President, OCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个警员都明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every policeman knows when he joins the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的工作有一定的危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there are certain inherent risks that come with the territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不信的话 可以问他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask any cop, he'll tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不能承受压力 还是不要干好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"if you can't stand the heat, you better stay out of the kitchen."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克警员负伤逃命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although seriously wounded, Officer Frank Frederickson escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且认出这个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and identified this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,底特律旧城区的 黑帮首领克来伦·鲍迪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarence Boddicker, unofficial crime boss of Old Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,涉嫌与31名警员之死有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now sought in connection with the deaths of 31 police officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前他正消遥法外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, he's at large,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而福特医院的医生们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}while doctors at Henry Ford Memorial Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在抢救法兰克警员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fight to save the life of Officer Frank Frederickson.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克 祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:06.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（底特律 西区警局）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图谋杀 他没有杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attempted murder? It's not like he killed someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这侵犯我当事人的公民权益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a clear violation of my client's civil rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,改控袭击我就马上可以付保释金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it aggravated assault, and I can make bail, in cash, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的当事人是个混蛋 你也是个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, pal, your client's a scumbag, you're a scumbag,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.11,0:03:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋们要见法官的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and scumbags see the judge on Monday morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开我的警察局 还要带走那个小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get out of my police station, and take laughing boy with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有权保持沉默 了解吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the right to remain silent. Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 被抓过吗 - 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Priors? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 从南区调派来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Murphy. Transferring in from Metro South.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错的警察局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice precinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里靠工作维生吧 拿你的装备吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We work for a living down here, Murphy. Get your armor and suit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.36,0:03:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请带我回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please take me home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行 去拿杯咖啡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, E.J. Get a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sarge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:04:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,史达 法兰克有消息吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark, is there any word on Frederickson?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然不容乐观{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still listing him as critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老婆一定会发疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife must be going out of her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 墨菲 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Murphy, huh? - Yeah, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 文森 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manson. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么让你来到这里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What brings you to this little paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,OCP调派了很多新人来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats me, man. I think OCP's moving a lot of new guys up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,普及消费者产品 一群笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Omni Consumer Products. What a bunch of morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会把这个部门搞得一团糟的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna manage this department right into the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从哪里来的 - 南区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you from? - Metro South.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到地狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.01,0:04:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 墨菲 - 在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Murphy. - Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.43,0:04:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,消减了东区十个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cut 10 guys loose over on the east side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有麻烦时才增加人手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try to get backup when you're in a jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇上麻烦后才找救兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, try to get a medevac after you've been jammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你我们该做什么 就是罢工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what we should do. We should strike. Fuck 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.03,0:04:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,（法兰克）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,丧礼明天举行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The funeral's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,部门要求所有休假警员出席{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The department requests all officers not on duty to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:05:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有奠仪按照惯例交给西素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any donations for the family may be given to Cecil as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.59,0:05:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再听到罢工的言论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want to hear any more talk about strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是水管工 我们是警务人员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not plumbers. We're police officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,警务人员是不罢工的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And police officers don't strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 出动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy, front and center.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.95,0:05:32.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（墨菲）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好威猛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.43,0:05:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:06:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯 你处理完那个嫌犯就过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis, come here when you're finished fucking around with your suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的新伙伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's gonna be your new partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 这是路易斯 带他到附近看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy, meet Lewis. Show him the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to know you, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,身手不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不认识路线 还是我来开车吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better drive until you know your way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我在了解我的新伙伴时 都是我开车的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I usually drive when I'm breaking in a new partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为那个老头会在场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think the old man is gonna be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何邀请我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they invite us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有部门主管都带了支援队来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All division heads are bringing their support teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是件大事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.79,0:06:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会通过三角洲城计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure they're green-lighting Delta City.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 他们从不提前行事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you kidding? They never do anything ahead of schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯已经准备好209系列 想夸耀一番{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Jones. He's got the 209 series online and now he wants to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.55,0:07:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棘手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a tough break, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.17,0:07:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,ED209出现严重延误时…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ED 209 ran into serious delays and cost overruns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,老头下令要有后备计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man ordered a backup plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,95楼 祝君愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}95th floor. Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能想挫挫琼斯的锐气吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just to light a fire under Jones' ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 老鲍伯获得那个任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Old Bob here gets the assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安概念部的人都不以篇然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody in Security Concepts takes it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的琼斯 我可以的话也会直接找老头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a better plan. Fucking Jones! I'd go straight to the Old Man if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟琼斯作对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mess with Jones, man. He'll make sushi out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 听说他不是好惹的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you better be careful, man. I heard Jones is a real shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 笨蛋 谁问过你 - 鲍伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who asked you, twerp? - Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方有什么问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about this police thing, what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我们接手后 他们的工会一直捣乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their union's been bitching ever since we took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如往常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the usual nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们会扭转局势的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll turn things around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好 我们开始吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm. Good, very good. Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,十多年来我一直有这个梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had this dream for more than a decade now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个我邀请各位一起分享的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dream which I've invited you all to share with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月后我们会开始兴建三角洲城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In six months, we begin construction of Delta City.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.53,0:08:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在现在底特律旧城的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where Old Detroit now stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老城有一个弊病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old Detroit has a cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是犯罪问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cancer is crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们雇用二百万名工人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it must be cut out before we employ the 2 million workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在城里大兴土木前一定要制止它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will breathe life into this city again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,调整税制已经为机构{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although shifts in the tax structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造理想的经营环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have created an economy ideal for corporate growth,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但社会服务 也就是指执行法规…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}community services, in this case law enforcement,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,却受到损害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们是时候回馈社会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time we gave something back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,细心看看本公司的以前的成绩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a close look at the track record of this company.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位就会知道我们曾经冒险…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll see that we have gambled in markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,投资在被视为无利可图的市场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}traditionally regarded as nonprofit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院 监狱 太空探索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hospitals, prisons, space exploration.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.43,0:09:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为商机无限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say good business is where you find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在有合约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, we've entered into a contract with the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可在本地执行法规{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to run local law enforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对于安保概念…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at Security Concepts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.99,0:09:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信一支有效率的警队 只是解决问题的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we believe an efficient police force is only part of the solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We need something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一个24小时当班的警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a 24-hour-a-day police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不用吃 不用睡觉的警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cop that doesn't need to eat or sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个配备强劲火力和反应敏锐的警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cop with superior firepower and the reflexes to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位同事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellow executives,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我诚意为大家介绍 执行法纪的未来精英{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it gives me great pleasure to introduce you to the future of law enforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,ED209{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed 209.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.89,0:10:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,执法机械人209系列 是个自给自足的执法机械人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Enforcement Droid series 209 is a self-sufficient law enforcement robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.39,0:10:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,209被设定保卫市区安宁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}209 is currently programmed for urban pacification,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那只是个开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过一次到旧城区出巡后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a successful tour of duty in Old Detroit,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以预期209会成为 未来十年热门的军用产品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can expect 209 to become the hot military product for the next decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦菲马纳博士 - 我们需要一个目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr. McNamara. - We'll need an arrest subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯尼 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Kinney. - Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可否帮个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you come up and give us a hand, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.25,0:11:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼先生会帮我们模拟一次 典型的拘捕和缴械过程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kinney is going to help us simulate a typical arrest and disarming procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼先生 用你的枪作威吓状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kinney, use your gun in a threatening manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指着ED209 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Point it at Ed 209. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你放下武器 你有20秒时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please put down your weapon. You have 20 seconds to comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.61,0:11:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是依它的话做吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'd better do what he says, Mr. Kinney.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有15秒时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You now have 15 seconds to comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你触犯了刑法第113条第9节 - 切断电源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnArial\fs16}- You are in direct violation of Penal Code 113, Section 9. - Cut the power! Pull the board!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有五秒时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You now have five seconds to comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,四 三 二 一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.59,0:12:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在有权使用武力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am now authorized to use physical force.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.33,0:12:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,太恐怖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}WOIt's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要叫急救人员吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody want to call a goddamn paramedic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 强生 我们走吧 - 这件事就此了结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go, Johnson! - You pull the plug on this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要碰他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, don't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要碰他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它听不到丢下枪的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't hear the gun drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它听不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克 我很失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick, I'm very disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是小故障 暂时失灵罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it's only a glitch, a temporary setback.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫这做小故障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this a glitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在六个月内就动工了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're scheduled to begin construction in six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:13:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个故障会害苦我们 单是利息就损失5千万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your temporary setback could cost us $50 million in interest payments alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not necessarily, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个机器战警计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you're aware of the Robocop program.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我研究出来应变这种事故的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnArial\fs16}developed by myself at Security Concepts as a contingency against just this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your concern, Mr. Morton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure this is something we can take up in my office…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会 迪克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, wait a minute. Dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能要重新估计了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe what we need here is a fresh perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说你的计划 需要多久的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about your plan, Mr. Morton. How long will it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready to go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.47,0:13:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们调派了一些合适人选重组警务处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\fnArial\fs15.9}We've restructured the police department and placed prime candidates according to risk factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.39,0:13:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们九十天内可以制出样本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm confident that we can go to prototype within 90 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 召集你的手下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, very good. Get your staff together, Mr. Morton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十分钟后开会作介绍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll expect a full presentation in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是取胜之道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Now, that's how it's done in the big leagues, Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧机会 全力以赴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see an opening, you go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小心点 琼斯会对付你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better watch your back, Bob. Jones is going to come looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的 他弄得一塌糊涂 我只是收拾残局罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck Jones. He fumbled the ball and I was there to pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:13:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼真是不幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad about Kinney.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是大城市常见的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's life in the big city.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们何时开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到个蠢蛋自愿者就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as some poor schmuck volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,3509单位 请到河街和葛兰街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit 3509, proceed to Hall and Grand. 411 involving indigents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我们马上出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, we're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.07,0:14:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,身手不错呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty fancy moves, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子看这个叫TJ里查的 警匪电视节目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my son, Jimmy, watches this cop show, TJ Lazer,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,里查杀死坏人时就做这个动作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this Lazer guy does this every time he takes down a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子认为每个好警察…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So naturally, my kid thinks every good cop should be…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想令他失望吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't want to disappoint him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,以身作则对孩子是很重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, role models can be very important to a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也有同感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, I get a kick out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.97,0:14:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位 第九区…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, all units, sector 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是… - 211正在途中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's for… - 211 in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开车吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:15:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,…疑犯持有枪械 属高度危险人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the suspects are armed and considered dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然烧那些钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You burned the fucking money!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把门炸开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to blow the door. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是有记号的 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as good as marked, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid, stupid asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克来伦 - 你想怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clarence! - What? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有警察跟踪我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a cop on our tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 开快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, speed it up! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们敌不过警察的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This crate ain't gonna outrun a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开慢点 - 你疯了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Slow down, then. - What, are you crazy, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 做吧 照做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up and do it! Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.44,0:15:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是154 我们正追截疑匪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central, this is 154. We're in pursuit of 211 suspect.
