Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 154{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, 154.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 暂时没有支持 - 把你的枪给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Backup currently unavailable. - Give me your piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持15分钟后赶到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backup E.T.A., 15 minutes.
