Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家上子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody load up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.87,0:15:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好 我们来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 他去了哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck? Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿苗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emil?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.26,0:16:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here! He's up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在旁边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,射他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,克来伦 我的脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, Clarence, my leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,利昂 扶起他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leon, pick him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备了吗 - 不 等一会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready? - No, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,波比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波比 你会飞吗 - 克来伦 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you fly, Bobby? - Clarence, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.62,0:17:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是154{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central, this is unit 154.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在3D区找到那辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We located that van by the old mill in Sector 3D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 支援的人呢 - 暂时没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, where is that backup? - Backup is still unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计在10分钟后才到达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We estimate 10 minutes before units can arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你决定吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.25,0:17:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们来吧 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's do it. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持联络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,举高手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's see those hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.99,0:18:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我拉上裤链吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I zip this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:19:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打劫银行 但从不留下赃款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep robbing banks, but we never get to keep the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱滚钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes money to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.01,0:19:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们偷钱买毒品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We steal money to buy coke,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后卖出毒品赚大钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then sell the coke to make even more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,资金投资{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capital investment, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必费神 偷回来就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, why bother making it when we can just steal it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.44,0:19:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有方法比偷东西这种自由贸易更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no better way to steal money than free enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吸烟吗 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smoke? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些东西会害死你的 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, those things will kill you. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想长命百岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to live forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,比西比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}BiXby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大的蛋糕啊 哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a cake! Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.21,0:19:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管生死 你也要束手就擒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead or alive, you're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis. Lewis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯 我这里有状况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis, I got a situation here, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:19:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 老兄 站起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, tough guy, get up! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身 分开双腿 对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around. Spread your legs. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯 你在哪里 没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis, where are you? You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.24,0:20:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手放头上 路易斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands on your head. Lewis?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿苗 我们来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you let us take over from here, Emil?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你死定了 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your ass is mine. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet it ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:21:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老哥 你是个好警察吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a good cop, hotshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是个了不起的警察 独个儿来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you got to be some kind of great cop to come in here all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.15,0:21:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伙伴在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伙伴在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙儿 另一个在楼上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, guys, the other one was upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很甜美呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was sweet, mmm, mmm, mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.45,0:21:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我处置了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样使你很生气吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet that really pisses you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能认为我不是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably don't think I'm a very nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你是人渣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, I think you're slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是有这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I got this problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察都不喜欢我 所以我不喜欢警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops don't like me, so I don't like cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.71,0:22:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,扶他一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, give the man a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你们的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 转身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, look out. - Turn around, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,俊男 这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty boy, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有子弹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! I'm out of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.25,0:23:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.43,0:23:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,克来伦 他还没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Clarence, he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.89,0:23:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛不痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it hurt? Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 玩够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fun's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.45,0:23:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,英伟的王子 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, sweet prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.79,0:23:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait up, wait up, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.02,0:24:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy-
