Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.51,0:24:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他氧气罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the ventilator.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.01,0:24:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,推他到四号手术室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him in OR 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.10,0:24:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 转弯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy. Turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.98,0:24:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow it down now. Slow it down, slow it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.69,0:24:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hit the door.
