Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.53,0:24:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压六十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a pressure of 60 palp.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.49,0:24:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要给他插喉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we have to intubate this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.50,0:25:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行环状软骨压迫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apply cricoid pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.21,0:25:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,放进去了 可有呼吸声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right, I got it in. Breath sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.83,0:25:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行了 - 另一边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're in. - Other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.00,0:25:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,装起保护设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go ahead and get the MAST trousers up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.72,0:25:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱掉衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.01,0:25:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服脱掉 准备检查中枢神经{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, clothes off. Let's prep him for a central line.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.10,0:25:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽一点血 验血型 要六个单位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get some blood drawn. Type and crossing, six units.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压正在下降{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His pressure's dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.90,0:25:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,中枢神经有反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I've got a central line in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.06,0:25:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压恢复 注入盐水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting pressure back. Normal saline.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.86,0:25:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你做得到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.04,0:25:30.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（TJ里查 今晚8点）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.95,0:25:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really have to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.70,0:25:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 血压怎样 - 四十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's our blood pressure? - I've got 40 palp.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.03,0:25:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.38,0:25:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,V纤维颤动要用震荡器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coarse V-Fib. Okay, we got to shock him.
