Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.30,0:25:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,放进佛利器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the patches.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.21,0:25:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走保护设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the Foley in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.88,0:25:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备电击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go ahead and blow his MAST trousers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.09,0:25:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.34,0:25:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 电击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand clear. Shock him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.35,0:26:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.27,0:26:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,V纤维颤动 再震他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coarse V-Fib. Let's shock him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.06,0:26:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.94,0:26:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.19,0:26:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没反应 来吧 注射强心剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flatline. Let's go intracardiac epinephrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.07,0:26:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.44,0:26:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.40,0:26:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 注射了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.41,0:26:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有脉搏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.62,0:26:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,再震动一次 没反应就放弃吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go ahead and shock a flat line, and let's quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.66,0:26:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 大家退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, everybody, clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.87,0:26:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.75,0:26:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 我们已经尽力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I think that's all we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 死亡时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's call it. What's the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.51,0:26:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,6点15分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}6:15.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.94,0:26:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始启动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's starting to roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.82,0:27:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是开的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.20,0:27:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit! - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.95,0:27:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.71,0:27:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿发光二极管来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring in the L.E.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.87,0:27:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁好它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's lock it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.30,0:27:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他启动了 - 情况怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's on. - What's the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.89,0:27:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保住了左手臂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were able to save the left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.64,0:27:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我们说好了 全身装假肢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I thought we agreed on total body prosthesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.60,0:27:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 割掉那只手臂 - 天啊 莫顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, lose the arm, okay? - Jesus, Morton.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.98,0:27:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能理解吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can he understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.65,0:27:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们反正会洗掉他的记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter. We're gonna blank his memory, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.02,0:27:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该割掉那只手臂 你认为怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we should lose the arm. What do you think, Johnson?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.69,0:27:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他加入警队时签了弃权书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he signed the release forms when he joined the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.99,0:27:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且他已经死了 我们可以随意处置的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's legally dead. We can do pretty much what we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.91,0:27:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,割掉那只手臂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose the arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.33,0:27:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉他 准备进行手术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut him down. Prep him for surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.21,0:27:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,表皮会是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire outer skin will be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是钦金属 铺上合成纤维{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's titanium laminated with Kevlar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.96,0:27:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 跟他握手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Shake his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常来这里 你好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here often? How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.39,0:28:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.52,0:28:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,握得真有力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a hell of a grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.06,0:28:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有四百磅 他可以握碎你每一寸骨头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 400 foot-pounds. He could crush every bone in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.19,0:28:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 将它接在肩膀上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Attach it to his shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.65,0:28:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.12,0:28:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会是个大混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna be a bad motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.87,0:28:31.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（下载记忆）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.54,0:28:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 他望着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}WOHey, look, look! He's watching us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.42,0:28:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.84,0:28:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi! - Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.72,0:28:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,新年快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}WOHappy new year!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.05,0:28:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.43,0:28:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,新年快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.90,0:28:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是两者兼得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get the best of both worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:28:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在最快速的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fastest reflexes modern technology has to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.48,0:29:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算机记忆反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on board computer-assisted memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.32,0:29:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,和永久的警察巡逻计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a lifetime of on-the-street law enforcement programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.57,0:29:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴为大家介绍…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my great pleasure to present to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.41,0:29:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器战警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robocop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.58,0:29:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.54,0:29:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为你而设的 给你的 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. That's for you. That's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.67,0:29:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.61,0:29:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你们所谓的惯犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am what you call a repeat offender.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.28,0:29:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再犯罪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, I will offend again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.69,0:29:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受最高指示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get my orders from a higher source.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.03,0:29:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.37,0:29:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈知道你是这样讲话的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your mother know you talk like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.58,0:29:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠旁边进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him in through the side door.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.95,0:29:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,已设了一间房间作观察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This holding cell has been set up for observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.83,0:29:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.92,0:29:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是怎么一回事 - 他是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this all about? - Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.67,0:29:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰瑞德警官 - 这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sergeant John Reed. - What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.59,0:30:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是OCP的公事 所以麻烦你走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about official OCP business. So please, get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.22,0:30:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有四 五天…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we've got four or five days setup…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.93,0:30:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说八道 我只听从…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this is bullshit! I take my orders from…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.45,0:30:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.74,0:30:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.53,0:30:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 等等我 - 去看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, wait for me, partner. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.95,0:30:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.00,0:30:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.47,0:30:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息时你会坐在椅子上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you are at rest, you will sit in the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.89,0:30:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.97,0:30:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪又怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about tracking?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.47,0:30:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用这个来追踪他的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can check his exact location at all times with one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.90,0:31:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎样进食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.27,0:31:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的消化系统很简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His digestive system is extremely simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.48,0:31:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个处理器配制出一种浆糊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This processor dispenses a rudimentary paste.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.61,0:31:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持他的生理系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that sustains his organic system.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.95,0:31:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道好像婴儿食物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tastes like baby food.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享受吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.93,0:31:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先从追踪开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's start with tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.72,0:31:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我一个方位 - 收到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me a grid. - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.89,0:31:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.02,0:31:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目标 - 清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Target? - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.18,0:31:37.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瞄准中）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.23,0:31:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目标 - 清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Target. - Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.56,0:31:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在跟着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.02,0:31:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.61,0:31:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音重量分析器 一 二…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voice stress analyzer, one, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.07,0:31:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…three.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.36,0:31:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 清楚 - 记录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check. - Record.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.66,0:31:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回放 - 加强至一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now playback. - Bring it up 50%.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.37,0:31:55.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（回放）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.54,0:31:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回放 - 加强至一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now playback. - Bring it up 50%.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.08,0:31:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,全画面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a full frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.33,0:32:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他准备好了 - 好 让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got it. - All right, clear out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.92,0:32:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的最高指令是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are your prime directives?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.13,0:32:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,服务大众 保护无辜者 执行法纪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serve the public trust, protect the innocent, uphold the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.35,0:32:11.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（首要指令 1：取得公众信任 2：保护无辜者 3：执行法纪）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.93,0:32:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.39,0:32:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.93,0:32:24.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（指令4：机密）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.02,0:32:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死那个家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucking love that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.23,0:33:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是超级警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lewis, it's Supercop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.81,0:33:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那支手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that fucking gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.66,0:33:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.75,0:33:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这家伙很出色 - 他不是人 是机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This guy's really good. - He's not a guy. He's a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.67,0:33:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想怎样 取代我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they gonna do, replace us?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.22,0:33:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.81,0:33:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞德 - 是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reed. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.23,0:33:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要一辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.36,0:33:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.82,0:33:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 不用客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.36,0:33:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,去对付他们吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Go get 'em, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.98,0:34:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,付多少钱我也愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd buy that for a dollar!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.58,0:34:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 还有什么需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will there be anything else, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.62,0:34:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把收款机的钱全放进袋子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, empty the register and put the money in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.34,0:34:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.05,0:34:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说把所有的钱给我 别跟我耍花招{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said give me your money and all of it, and don't fuck with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.67,0:34:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now move!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.93,0:34:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,老头 打开保险箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the safe, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.51,0:35:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开保险箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the goddamn safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.35,0:35:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有保险箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.97,0:35:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 你的保险箱在那里 快打开它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! There's your goddamn safe! Open that son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.89,0:35:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拖延 快打开那个东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit stalling, man! I'm gonna count to three! You better open that son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.27,0:35:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.82,0:35:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会干掉她的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna blow her brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.32,0:35:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会打开保险箱 - 乖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll open the safe. - Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.11,0:35:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.45,0:35:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数三声你就要打开它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you better open that on the count of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.45,0:35:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.29,0:35:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.13,0:35:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下那支枪 你被拘捕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the gun. You are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.42,0:35:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck me! Fuck me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.46,0:35:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck me! Fuck me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.30,0:35:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck me! Fuck me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.64,0:35:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.65,0:35:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你合作 晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your cooperation. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.82,0:36:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,付多少钱我也愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll buy that for a dollar!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.54,0:36:10.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第三街及拿许路有罪案发生）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.67,0:36:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们不要 别碰我 走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me! Get away! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.47,0:36:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不要你的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want your bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.18,0:36:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.72,0:36:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 我们不想伤害你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy! We don't want to hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.89,0:36:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多头发了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too much hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.02,0:36:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们替她剪发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, we'll give her a haircut!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.23,0:36:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hey. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.53,0:36:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面有更多毛发呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more hair down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.24,0:36:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.00,0:36:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.50,0:36:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.67,0:36:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:36:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开那个女人 你们被拘捕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the woman go. You are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.59,0:37:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.80,0:37:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 你还是退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better back up, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他要干她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause, he's gonna kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.47,0:37:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要杀死她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.35,0:37:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这妹子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.31,0:37:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要杀死她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill her, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.23,0:37:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要杀死她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.49,0:37:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你了 变态鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your move, creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.20,0:37:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.07,0:37:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.75,0:37:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓死我了 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so scared. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.25,0:37:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.59,0:37:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,太太 你受惊了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, you have suffered an emotional shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.30,0:37:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会通知一个强奸危机应变中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will notify a rape crisis center.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.44,0:37:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位 第六区 请封锁交汇处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, Sector 6, please close intersections…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.20,0:38:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管 赶那些人去楼梯边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. Get those men by the stairs now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.45,0:38:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.41,0:38:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,本市政府从不着重应付恐怖活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrorism has never been a factor in city politics before.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.62,0:38:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天情况有变了 因为前议员密朗…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that changed today when former city councilman Ron Miller.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.58,0:38:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,持枪闯进了大会堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}entered City Hall with a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.34,0:38:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在二楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's now on the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.80,0:38:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,挟持着吉布森市长和他的下属作人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}holding Mayor Gibson and his staff hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.46,0:38:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信密朗已经杀死其中一名人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do believe that Miller has killed one of the hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.80,0:38:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 下一步怎样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.51,0:38:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等候 恐怖活动很棘手的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wait. Terrorism is a very tricky business.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.76,0:38:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻作大规模反击是上策{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximum and immediate retaliation is the best policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.98,0:38:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But unfortunately…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.14,0:38:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.27,0:38:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你们去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.48,0:38:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,请发表一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Statement, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.32,0:38:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要控制人群 叫那些人退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have some crowd control! Come on, get these people back!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.87,0:38:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.79,0:38:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他继续谈话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.12,0:38:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁制造你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who made you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.17,0:39:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否战无不胜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you invincible?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.72,0:39:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,密朗 不要伤害市长 我们会答应你所有的要求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Miller, don't hurt the Mayor. We'll give you whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.22,0:39:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 不要耍我 我是拼了命的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, don't fuck with me! I'm a desperate man!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.85,0:39:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 我要一些新鲜咖啡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And second, I want some fresh coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.56,0:39:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三 我要重新点票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And third, I want a recount!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.65,0:39:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管结果如何 我要恢复职位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no matter how it turns out, I want my old job back!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.07,0:39:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay-
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.36,0:39:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要一个更大的办公室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want a bigger office!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.95,0:39:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要一辆新车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want a new car!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.78,0:39:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部由市政府支付{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want the City to pay for it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.70,0:39:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要哪款车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of car, Miller?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.99,0:39:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有真皮活动座位…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something with reclining leather seats,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.04,0:39:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要快速和费油量的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that goes really fast and gets really shitty gas mileage!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.04,0:39:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,6000 SUX型好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about the 6000 SUX?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.79,0:39:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 可以的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Okay, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.05,0:39:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有没有速度调节的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about cruise control? Does it come with cruise control?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.34,0:39:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 放走市长吧 我们还可以送你汽车音响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no problem, Miller. Let the Mayor go, we'll even throw in a Blaupunkt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.10,0:39:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官 不要耍我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, don't jerk me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.39,0:40:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家耍我时我会杀了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When people jerk me off, I kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看看吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.78,0:40:08.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（热能录像）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.57,0:40:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长 站起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, Your Honor, get up. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.07,0:40:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 你的市民想看看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your public wants to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.49,0:40:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没有人认真对待我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody ever takes me seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.50,0:40:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在认真一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get serious now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.37,0:40:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟市长道别吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kiss the Mayor's ass good-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.97,0:40:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器战警是谁 他是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robocop. Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.14,0:40:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是什么 他从何而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he? Where does he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.81,0:40:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是OCP革命性的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's OCP's newest soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.10,0:40:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪案管理计划的最新战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in their revolutionary crime management program.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.65,0:40:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,OCP发言人声称这具无畏的机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OCP Spokesmen claim that the fearless machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.27,0:40:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,令底特律旧城的匪徒闻风丧胆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has crooks on the run in Old Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.44,0:40:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 艾亚科卡小学的学生可一睹…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, kids at Lee lacocca Elementary School got to meet in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.36,0:40:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们父母只能在漫画看到的人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what their parents only read about in comic books.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.32,0:40:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 机械人 有什么特别讯息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robe, excuse me, Robe. Any special message.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.78,0:40:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给在家中收看的孩子们吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all the kids watching at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.29,0:41:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要惹上麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.29,0:41:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨西哥危机再度升级{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More fighting in the Mexican crisis today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.63,0:41:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,美军和墨西哥国民军连手突击…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when American troops participated in a joint raid with Mexican nationals.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.38,0:41:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付部署在阿科普科的叛军火箭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}against rebel rocket positions in Acapulco.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.63,0:41:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.72,0:41:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色警报…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red alert. Red alert. Red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.51,0:41:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你越过了我的死亡界线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crossed my line of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.06,0:41:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有拆掉你的MX武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't dismantled your MX stockpile.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.48,0:41:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴基斯坦威胁着我的边境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pakistan is threatening my border.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.60,0:41:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 不可再有军事援助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, buster. No more military aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.32,0:41:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,核武大战 快从速装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nukem, get them before they get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.11,0:41:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕氏兄弟出品的另一优质家庭游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another quality home game from butler brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.20,0:41:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天劳工领袖都同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, labor leaders agreed to sanction construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.99,0:41:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持兴建OCP的三角洲城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of OCP's Delta City,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.62,0:41:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,此举会制造一百万个新职位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}thereby creating an estimated one million much-needed new jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.92,0:41:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管在危险的旧城区 工人的安全仍成疑问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}despite questions about worker safety in dangerous Old Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.75,0:41:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,OCP保安概念部副总裁罗伯·莫顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robert Morton, vice president, Security Concepts, OCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.47,0:41:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能对三角洲城置评{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I can't comment on Delta City.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.63,0:41:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以告诉大家以下的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not my division. But I will tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.55,0:41:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安概念部估计在40天内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Security Concepts, we're projecting the end of crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.56,0:42:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,会将旧城区的罪案灭绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Old Detroit within 40 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.31,0:42:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,本市有一个新家伙 他名叫机器战警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a new guy in town. His name's Robocop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.11,0:42:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯仔… 副总裁 恭喜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Bobby boy. Vice president. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.78,0:42:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,周二晚玩手球吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handball Tuesday night?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.07,0:42:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, I'd love to. But I got a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.57,0:42:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我请了一些模特儿来我家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple models coming over to my place. Know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.87,0:42:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,付多少钱我也愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd buy that for a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.33,0:42:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯 欢迎加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the club, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.58,0:42:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…那是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and that's a true story.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.13,0:42:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你借着机器战警 在保安概念部声名大噪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making a real name for yourself in Security Concepts with Robocop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.92,0:42:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.55,0:42:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我一些底细吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in on the bottom line, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.55,0:42:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说琼斯很生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear Jones was plenty pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.18,0:42:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有这个杀手人物 但那是个烟幕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know, he's got this killer rep, but it's a smokescreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.14,0:42:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是只无牙老虎 是个胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's face it, he's lost his teeth. The guy's a pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.89,0:42:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是否说着同一个迪克·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we talking about the same Dick Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.73,0:42:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他年老 我们年轻 人生就是那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, he's old, we're young, and that's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.62,0:43:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lgot to…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.58,0:43:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了 要开会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go. I got a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.38,0:43:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯 恭喜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.64,0:43:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.64,0:43:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我在这间公司 做初级行政人员时…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember when I was a young executive for this company.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.64,0:43:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给老板取了一些花名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to call the old man funny names.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.52,0:43:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁屁股{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron Butt,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.61,0:43:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boner.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.02,0:43:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次我甚至叫他做… 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once, I even called him asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.53,0:43:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但永远尊敬着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was always respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.37,0:43:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远知道在哪里定下底线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew where the line was drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.79,0:43:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却越过它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just stepped over it, buddy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.21,0:43:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你侮辱了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've insulted me, and you've insulted this company.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.09,0:43:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的混账创作也侮辱了这间公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that bastard creation of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.68,0:44:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有ED209的军事售卖保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a guaranteed military sale with Ed 209!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.14,0:44:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,革新计划 售卖零件25年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renovation program. Spare parts for 25 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.10,0:44:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,管创于不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares if it worked or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.31,0:44:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板认为这件事很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man thought it was pretty important,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.73,0:44:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.70,0:44:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 他是个老好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he's a sweet old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.79,0:44:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是出于好意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he means well.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.25,0:44:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不是长生不老的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not going to live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.55,0:44:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这里的第二号总管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm number two around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.18,0:44:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单的数学 是不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty simple math, huh, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.68,0:44:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.02,0:44:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,针对错人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fucked with the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.60,0:44:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your fucking mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.15,0:45:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好求神拜佛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.61,0:45:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个怪物不会出差错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that that unholy monster of yours doesn't screw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.43,0:45:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你饿吗 - 不 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hungry? - No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.43,0:46:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.98,0:46:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些该死的叛军炸毁了阿科普科机场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn rebels blew up the airport in Acapulco yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.94,0:46:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉 我们下周要去那里 那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. We were going there next week. Wait, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.16,0:46:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 拼命小子启动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look! Bucket boy's online.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.39,0:46:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 别走 等一会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt. Stop! Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.93,0:46:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.43,0:46:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 他刚走了 - 他走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. He just left. - Just left?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.65,0:46:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗士福{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roosevelt!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.81,0:47:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosie, we got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.49,0:47:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.82,0:47:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.66,0:47:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 找罗伯·莫顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Call Bob Morton!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.63,0:47:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰利 逮捕他 我稍后回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry, book him. I'll catch up with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.72,0:47:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我没有机会好好地自我介绍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I haven't really had a chance to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.06,0:47:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是路易斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Lewis.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.19,0:47:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有名字吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.40,0:47:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯警员 有什么可以效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you, Officer Lewis?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.41,0:47:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那个意思 你没有名字的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not really what I meant. Don't you have a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.41,0:47:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 在这里签名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it. Just sign right here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.04,0:47:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白 我是OCP的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. I'm OCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.17,0:48:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.97,0:48:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不记得我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't remember me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.43,0:48:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.18,0:48:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.22,0:48:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有地方会发生罪案的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere there is a crime happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.56,0:48:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.23,0:48:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他说了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you talk to him about? What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.90,0:48:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没什么 - 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing. - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.40,0:48:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.57,0:48:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.87,0:48:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有麻烦了 警员 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a lot of trouble, Officer! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.08,0:48:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间警察局答应全面合作的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was assured full cooperation by this precinct, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.92,0:48:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手下弄坏了事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if it gets screwed up by one of your grunts,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.88,0:48:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会开除你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.05,0:48:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最新情况怎样 - 不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the update? - It's hard to be 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.92,0:48:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否有故障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a glitch or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.05,0:48:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有躯体反应设计的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This system was never designed to experience detailed somatic response.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.93,0:48:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做了一个梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a dream, a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.10,0:48:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个警员查问过他 - 我没有查问他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This cop saw fit to question him. - I didn't question him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.22,0:49:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问他的名字 他不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked him his name. He didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.48,0:49:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 让我们说清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Let me make it real clear for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.40,0:49:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有名字 他只是个程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have a name. He's got a program.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.86,0:49:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个产品 明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's product. Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.44,0:49:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.57,0:49:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓他回来进行全套系统机件检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we pull him in, run a systems check, the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.49,0:49:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能需要花七到十天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a week. Maybe 10 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.78,0:49:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,截断他的能源 因为他做了一个梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to take him offline because he had a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.95,0:49:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说笑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.45,0:49:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.66,0:49:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞德 听着 - 是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen, Reed. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.83,0:49:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,记着一件事 这个计划跟警察无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to keep one thing in mind. This project doesn't concern cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.87,0:49:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是机密的 它是OCP的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's classified. It's OCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.71,0:49:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.17,0:49:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.13,0:49:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.93,0:49:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们让他在街上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, we keep him on the street…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.51,0:49:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Sarge.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.68,0:49:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坏了事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.06,0:49:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 这家伙是个大混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it, kid. This guy's a serious asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.49,0:50:00.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（24小时营业）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.34,0:50:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,书虫 把所有的钱给我 否则我干掉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me all your money, bookworm, or I blow your brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.69,0:50:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在给七号加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now fill it up on number 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.78,0:50:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做傻事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do nothing stupid, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.20,0:50:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个神枪手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.25,0:50:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以从这里射中你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could hit you in the eye from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.91,0:50:47.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正在发生罪案）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.76,0:50:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,老哥… 你在看什么书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, what you reading in there?
