Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.35,0:51:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个大学生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a college boy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.23,0:51:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定以为自己很聪明了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you think you're pretty smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.23,0:51:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为可以敌过子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you could outsmart a bullet?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.65,0:51:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看个究竟 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.36,0:51:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟你说话 你认为怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking to you! What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.03,0:51:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟你说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.87,0:51:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.17,0:51:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管死活 你也要束手就擒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead or alive, you are coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.93,0:51:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
