Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.22,0:51:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们杀你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We killed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.02,0:51:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们杀你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We killed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.02,0:51:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们杀你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We killed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.12,0:52:05.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（回放）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.87,0:52:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.04,0:52:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们杀你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We killed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.79,0:52:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
