Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.32,0:53:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 你不能进入这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't enter here! Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.45,0:53:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a minute!
