Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.83,0:55:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎参观{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, shopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.08,0:55:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逛逛你的新居吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a stroll through your new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.75,0:55:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是ZM工业建的家庭独立屋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a one-family house built by ZEM Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.05,0:55:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,令仔近学校和商店…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Situated near schools and shopping centers,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.34,0:55:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个先进的发展区有七倍的增长率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this progressive development has a growth factor of 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.66,0:56:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.20,0:56:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你做得到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.01,0:56:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁负责在家里煮饭也不要紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and, say, it doesn't matter who cooks in your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.01,0:56:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个厨房是由食品概念设计的 使一切都变得容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because this kitchen by Food Concepts makes everything a snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.58,0:56:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.91,0:57:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 戴上帽子 他可爱吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get your hat on. Isn't he cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.58,0:57:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dad. Come on, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.50,0:57:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来照相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.88,0:57:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.44,0:57:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really have to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.69,0:57:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.33,0:57:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the master bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.20,0:57:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,多用途的空间 设计典雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A functional space with a touch of elegance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.62,0:57:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你考虑好了没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you thought it all over?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.08,0:57:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不给我开一个价钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not make me an offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.72,0:57:59.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拘捕状态）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.89,0:58:06.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拘捕状态 疑犯：利昂·纳许）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.78,0:58:18.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拘捕状态 疑犯：利昂·纳许）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.08,0:58:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,克来伦·鲍迪在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Clarence Boddicker?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.63,0:58:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.72,0:58:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 我们谈一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit! - Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.27,0:58:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.56,0:58:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它听起来有点特别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just something about the way it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.49,0:58:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,副总裁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vice president.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.70,0:58:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,令我兴奋极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just turns me on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.37,0:58:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真是了不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you girls are so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.95,0:59:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢跟聪明的女人在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I just… I love to be with intelligent women.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.74,0:59:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明是很性感的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart is so sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.87,0:59:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.37,0:59:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候只要我想起一样东西…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I could just think of something,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.38,0:59:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会令我欲火中烧的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it could just get me so horny.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.80,0:59:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪费脑力是可怕的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, a mind is a terrible thing to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.26,0:59:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.72,0:59:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很容易就觉得无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get bored so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.06,0:59:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.60,0:59:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你要很多刺激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need lots of stimulation, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.23,0:59:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 别动 - 我不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I do. Don't move. - I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.61,0:59:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.74,0:59:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.24,0:59:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗伯 留一点给我 - 放心吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bob, save some for me. - Don't worry. I'll…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.37,0:59:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是送香槟来 别走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be the champagne. Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.13,0:59:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.80,1:00:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,妹子们 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitches, leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.06,1:00:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, Bobby. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.89,1:00:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会找我吗 - 走啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gonna call me? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.64,1:00:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.94,1:00:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可知道我是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.77,1:00:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这件事你可以脱身 那你就…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think you're gonna get away with this…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.53,1:00:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.41,1:00:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,停手 你要什么我都给你 求你别杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! I'll give you anything you want! Just please, please don't kill me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.63,1:00:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 小伙子 迪克·琼斯在此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, buddy boy. Dick Jones here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.05,1:00:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你现在已经跪地求饶 想保住你的性命吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you're on your knees about now, begging for your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.80,1:00:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.22,1:00:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在不觉得那么意气风发了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't feel so cocky now, do you, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.47,1:00:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给你多少钱 我马上双倍给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he's paying you, I'll double it right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.60,1:00:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可知道可悲的是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what the tragedy is here, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.65,1:00:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本可以做朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have been friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.15,1:01:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不肯依循正确途径{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you wouldn't go through proper channels.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.24,1:01:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我头上动土{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went over my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.82,1:01:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样很痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.66,1:01:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但世事如常 这是老生常谈 为爱和光荣奋斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But life goes on. It's an old story, the fight for love and glory, huh, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.17,1:01:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你视它为一场游戏会好一点的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It helps if you think of it as a game, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.09,1:01:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,每场游戏都有赢家… 和输家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every game has a winner and a loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.35,1:01:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你输个精光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm cashing you out, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.49,1:01:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多管子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more tubing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.92,1:01:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,西尔 我不要付那个价钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I want to pay you that, Sal.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.54,1:02:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你要什么 价钱由我来定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a shit what you want to pay. I set the prices here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.72,1:02:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你没听清楚 底特律是由我操控的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, pal, maybe you haven't heard. I'm the guy in Old Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.26,1:02:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在我的市场占位置…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want space in my marketplace,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.39,1:02:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要给我大量折扣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have to give me a volume discount.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.27,1:02:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有折扣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not into discounts.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.89,1:02:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 给他看看 我们有什么圣诞礼物给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, show the man what we brought him for Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.28,1:02:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑一下 发财机会多的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it, chum. Good business is where you find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.58,1:02:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 让我说个清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let me try to put this in perspective.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.88,1:02:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经杀了一批警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed a bunch of cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.63,1:02:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你们在市区有很多联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word around is that you've got a lot of heavy connections downtown.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.93,1:02:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你令我很多朋友紧张起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make a lot of my friends nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.73,1:02:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多人想看到我这样的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people would love to see a guy like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.48,1:03:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,令你这样的人生意倒闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}put a guy like you out of business.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.44,1:03:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.61,1:03:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我说得不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm just not making myself clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.99,1:03:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想耍你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to fuck with you, Sal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.95,1:03:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有很多联系 我有销售组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got the connections. I got the sales organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.88,1:03:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有能力把这间工厂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the muscle to shove enough of this factory.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.75,1:03:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄得一团糟 你会鸡犬不宁的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so far up your stupid wop ass that you'll shit snow for a year.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.88,1:03:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰基 干掉这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankie, blow this cocksucker's head off.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.14,1:03:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns, guns, guns!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.48,1:03:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sal!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.94,1:03:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老虎队今晚出赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tigers are playing tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.36,1:03:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一场也不会错过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never miss a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.99,1:03:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说笑罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.50,1:04:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.30,1:04:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.68,1:04:22.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瞄准中）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.90,1:04:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,静静地过来 否则会有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come quietly or there will be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.58,1:04:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}FUCK you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.46,1:06:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,克来伦·鲍迪 你已经被拘捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarence Boddicker, you are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.55,1:06:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有权保持沉默{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.51,1:06:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}FUCK you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.39,1:06:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait a minute. Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.15,1:06:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受保护的 有人保护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm protected, man. I've got protection!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.52,1:06:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有权聘请律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the right to an attorney.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.15,1:06:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.37,1:06:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.83,1:06:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.29,1:06:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 混蛋 是另一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, you fuck! There's another guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.62,1:06:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是OCP的高级总裁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's OCP. He's a senior president.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.75,1:06:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所说的话可能会成为呈堂证供{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you say may be used against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.05,1:06:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是迪克·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dick Jones!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.43,1:07:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在乎吗 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it? You cocksucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.72,1:07:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替迪克·琼斯工作的 迪克·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work for Dick Jones. Dick Jones!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.93,1:07:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是OCP的第二号总管 OCP是管理警队的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the number two guy at OCP. OCP runs the cops!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.52,1:07:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.70,1:07:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.49,1:07:19.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（指令3：执行法纪）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.54,1:07:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是个警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I am a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.67,1:07:34.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拘捕状态）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.17,1:07:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢这样 但听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it any more than you do, Reed, but listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.84,1:07:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听着 混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.38,1:07:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说要关闭一支主要的市区警队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about shutting down a major metropolitan police force.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.47,1:07:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有警察 这个城市会大混乱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without cops, this city would tear itself apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.73,1:07:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,工会昨晚表决要罢工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Union thinks you should know there was a strike vote last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.73,1:07:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周我们死了五个同僚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost five guys last week.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.44,1:07:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在外面挨打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting creamed out there, Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.87,1:08:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Book him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.41,1:08:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么罪名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the charge?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.87,1:08:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是杀警凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a cop killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.13,1:08:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.72,1:08:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me my fucking phone call.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.10,1:08:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.35,1:08:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,律师们会在24小时内把你弄出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the lawyers will have you out in 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.48,1:08:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要别透露其他事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't say anything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.44,1:08:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你真的弄得一团糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, you really screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.91,1:09:34.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（回放）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.21,1:09:38.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克来伦·鲍迪 档案编号F5908520492）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.38,1:09:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在乎吗 我替迪克·琼斯工作的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it? I work for Dick Jones!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.89,1:09:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Jones!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.85,1:09:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替迪克·琼斯工作的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work for Dick Jones!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.02,1:09:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他管理OCP OCP是管理警队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He runs OCP. OCP runs the cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.02,1:09:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Officer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.82,1:10:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常我不接见没有预约的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't usually see anyone without an appointment,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.36,1:10:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你是例外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in your case, I'll make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.20,1:10:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被拘捕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.16,1:10:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么罪名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what charge?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.99,1:10:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,协助及教唆一名已知的重犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aiding and abetting a known felon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.45,1:10:11.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（违反处罚规则）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.54,1:10:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听来我有大麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like I'm in a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.58,1:10:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是拘捕我好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better take me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.88,1:10:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.96,1:10:20.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（产品违规）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.88,1:10:29.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（指令4）
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.68,1:10:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,警员 有什么问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Officer?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.48,1:10:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你有什么问题吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what's the matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.90,1:10:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一项称为指令四的保险政策{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little insurance policy called Directive 4.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.53,1:10:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我对你的心理状况作出的小贡献{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little contribution to your psychological profile.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.32,1:10:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你企图拘捕OCP高级人员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any attempt to arrest a senior officer of OCP.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.37,1:10:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会导致机件停顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}results in shutdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.33,1:10:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.46,1:11:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为你是个普通的警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you were an ordinary police officer?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.25,1:11:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们的产品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're our product.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.26,1:11:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让产品造反的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can't very well have our products turning against us, can we?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.01,1:11:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然有点反抗力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still a little fight left in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.81,1:11:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你想见见我一个朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'd like to meet a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.45,1:11:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀死罗伯·莫顿 因为他犯了错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to kill Bob Morton because he made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.66,1:11:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是时候清除那个错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's time to erase that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.86,1:12:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,找黑基卡来 大厦里有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put Lieutenant Hedgecock on the line. There's trouble in the tower!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.89,1:14:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.77,1:14:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 他是个警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, wait a second! - He's a cop, for God's sakes!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.31,1:14:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能那样做的 - 我们有命令要摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hedgecock! You can't do that! - We have orders to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.36,1:14:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 你们都是疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit! - You're maniacs!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.86,1:14:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,随意开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire at will.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.71,1:14:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.69,1:15:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.77,1:15:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.57,1:15:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.67,1:15:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move down!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.87,1:15:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,到另一层楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the next level.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.04,1:15:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,三楼 他在三楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant! Level 3, level 3. He's on level 3!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.71,1:15:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.21,1:15:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.78,1:16:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's back.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.03,1:16:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,又流行巨大了 因为越大越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big is back, because bigger is better.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.53,1:16:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,6000 SUX型号 一个美国传统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}6000 SUX. An American tradition.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.74,1:16:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 我是帕金斯 他是卡西黄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. I'm Jesse Perkins with Casey Wong.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.75,1:16:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要新闻 圣巴巴拉市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top story, Santa Barbara.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.96,1:16:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,装在战略性防卫和平平台上的 一支激光大炮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}10, 000 acres of wooded residential land were scorched in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.92,1:16:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天进行例行测试时失火…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when a laser cannon aboard the strategic defense peace platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.67,1:16:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧毁了一万亩树茂密树林覆盖的民居{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}misfired today during routine start-up tests.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.26,1:16:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casey.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.30,1:16:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,已知有113名的死者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it was a day of mourning for the families of 113 people known dead at this hour,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.10,1:16:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中包括两位前总统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}among them, two former United States Presidents.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.43,1:16:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在圣巴巴拉地区过着退休生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who had retired in the Santa Barbara area.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.98,1:16:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是国民哀痛的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A day of mourning for a country.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.15,1:16:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,警员工会代表和OCP今天继续谈判{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police union representatives and OCP continue negotiations today.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.28,1:16:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望避免在明晚午夜举行的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in hopes of averting a citywide strike by police,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.78,1:17:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,全市警员大罢工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}scheduled to begin tomorrow at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.45,1:17:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾斯顿·华金斯会有更多报导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Justin Ballard-Watkins has more.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.28,1:17:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仍在执勤 但明天又怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still on duty, but what about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.41,1:17:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们访问过住在治安恶劣的 勒盛顿区市民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the question we put to people in the crime-plagued Lexington area.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.83,1:17:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是公仆 他们有职业保障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're public servants. They got job security.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.13,1:17:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不应该罢工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not supposed to strike.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.96,1:17:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个自由社会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a free society,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.96,1:17:18.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（奇瓦罗·森本 失业人士）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.09,1:17:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没什么是自由的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}except there ain't nothin' free.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.84,1:17:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没有保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause there's no guarantees, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.68,1:17:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得靠自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.59,1:17:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是世界的定律{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the law of the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.85,1:17:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.77,1:17:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.48,1:17:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be remodeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.82,1:17:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 巴巴拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Barbara.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.99,1:17:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见迪克·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm here to see Dick Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.95,1:17:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,见完之后 我还有空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I'm done, I've got some free time.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.08,1:17:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你可以填补空档的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could fit me in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.96,1:17:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍迪先生 他在等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's expecting you, Mr. Boddicker.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.92,1:18:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以留着那块口香糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can keep the gum.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.30,1:18:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看起来不错 - 那个要量一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This looks good. - Get a measurement on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.93,1:18:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,川顺便拿铁锤来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring a hammer, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.02,1:18:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克老兄 怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dickie boy. How's tricks?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.69,1:18:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西仍然活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.02,1:18:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.69,1:18:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个拘捕你 把你打得遍体鳞伤的警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police officer who arrested you, the one you spilled your guts to.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.11,1:18:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我的脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Take a look at my face, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.70,1:18:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当时想杀我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.74,1:18:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个机械人 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a cyborg, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.20,1:18:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把你说的话录下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He recorded every word you said.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.75,1:18:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的记忆可以作为证据的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His memory's admissible as evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.04,1:18:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你牵连了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You involved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.80,1:18:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀死它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.97,1:18:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老总 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.01,1:18:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的公司制造那个鬼东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your company built the fucking thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.39,1:18:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却要我来应付它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I got to deal with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.81,1:18:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间耍这套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time for this bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.06,1:18:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself, Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.57,1:19:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但三角洲城两个月后就动工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Delta City begins construction in two months.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.07,1:19:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有两百万名工人住在拖车房屋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 2 million workers living in trailers.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.74,1:19:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是会有毒品 赌博 卖淫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means drugs, gambling, prostitution.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.58,1:19:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是懂得拓展新市场的人的新领域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgin territory for the man who knows how to open up new markets.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.29,1:19:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个人可以全权控制它…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One man could control it all,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.25,1:19:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,克来伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.67,1:19:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我们是朋友吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're gonna be friends after all,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.46,1:19:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.22,1:19:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.27,1:19:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要重型的火力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna need some major firepower.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.31,1:19:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可否找到军方武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got access to military weaponry?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.94,1:19:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们实际上就是军方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We practically are the military.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.57,1:20:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有带那支手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring the gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.32,1:20:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,警局里没有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The precinct was deserted.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.70,1:20:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天有一半人都没有上班{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half the force didn't show up for work today.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.24,1:20:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人在午夜都会开始离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else walks out at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.32,1:20:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我们在罢工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're on strike.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.99,1:20:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚你需要什么 只是随便拿了一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't sure what you needed. I sort of grabbed things.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.33,1:20:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.13,1:20:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说要这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.80,1:20:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了一些食物给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you some food.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.18,1:20:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢谢 我不饿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you. I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.29,1:21:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不喜欢看到这个的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not like what you're going to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.57,1:21:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 再见到你真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really good to see you again, Murphy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.21,1:22:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲有妻儿的 他们在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy had a wife and son. What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.75,1:22:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,丧礼之后… 她搬走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the funeral, she moved away.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.47,1:22:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去了哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.93,1:22:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为你死了 所以想重新过生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thought you were dead. She started over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.27,1:22:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.15,1:22:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不记得他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't remember them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.11,1:22:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理会我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.87,1:23:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维 生日快乐 她是我送的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday, Dave. She's from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.67,1:23:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以要你们两个吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can I have you both?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.00,1:23:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然可以 我们试过了 - 当然可以 我们试过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. We've had our shots. - Sure. We've had our shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.88,1:23:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,付多少钱我也愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd buy that for a dollar!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.85,1:23:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿苗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Emil.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.35,1:23:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇利吧酒店怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the Gray Bar Hotel?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.31,1:23:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 他们让我留下那件衬衫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad. They let me keep the shirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.73,1:23:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有人搞我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody popped my cherry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.19,1:23:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿苗 好吗 看见你真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emil, how you doing, man? Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.44,1:23:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! Hey! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.86,1:23:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我免费出狱时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First they let me out of jail for free,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.86,1:24:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在监狱的停车场找到这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then what do I find in the prison parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.70,1:24:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆全新的6000 SUX型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a brand new 6000 SUX.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.20,1:24:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还贴着车厂的标贴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got the factory sticker on it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.20,1:24:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,克来伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.87,1:24:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔有一辆你那样的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey's got a carjust like yours, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.04,1:24:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,克来伦 你认为怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Clarence, what do you think, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.93,1:24:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那里有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got there, Clarence?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.55,1:24:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait up for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.14,1:24:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,新玩具呢 我可以玩吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! A new toy! Can I play?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.81,1:24:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.35,1:24:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait… Wait a minute, Clarence, Clarence!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.27,1:24:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.53,1:24:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.70,1:24:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 车子不错呢 - 去你的 克来伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice car, Joe. - Fuck you, Clarence.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.74,1:24:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我试一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.87,1:24:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜蛇火箭炮 最新型的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cobra Assault Cannon. State of the art. Bang!Bang!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.79,1:24:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.21,1:24:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it up, faggot. Let a man…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.22,1:24:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己买吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, butthole! Get your own!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.63,1:25:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.27,1:25:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿另一支枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the other gun, Emil!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.44,1:25:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No car is safe!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.98,1:25:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,做吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, Emil!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.49,1:25:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个 你们抬头看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.71,1:25:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在钢铁厂 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the steel mill. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.96,1:25:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 别闹了 我们要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, cut the horseshit! We're moving out.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.80,1:25:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 阿苗 快上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Emil! Get your ass in the van!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.26,1:25:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 笨蛋 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, lard ass, let's move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.05,1:25:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 变态鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you, faggot!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.44,1:26:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.48,1:26:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的瞄准系统有点毛病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My targeting system is a little messed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.78,1:26:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.37,1:26:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我瞄准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aim for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.33,1:26:59.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瞄准中）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.75,1:27:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你锁定了没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you locked in now?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.46,1:27:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.93,1:27:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠左边一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little more to the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.22,1:27:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.65,1:27:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为很准确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure that's dead-on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.61,1:27:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,过奖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.92,1:27:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 动手吧 - 来吧 我们杀死他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. Let's do it. - Come on, man, let's smoke him!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.25,1:27:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拆除组来了 那个混…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wrecking crew is here! Where is that metallic mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.88,1:27:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip it up, Emil!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.88,1:27:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍花样 干掉他就是 阿苗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing fancy. Just kill him. Emil!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.18,1:27:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - In the van.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.43,1:27:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在应该离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.23,1:27:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是伙伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're partners.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.94,1:28:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.39,1:28:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.23,1:28:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,找我吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.58,1:28:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut him off! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.62,1:28:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快点干掉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, cut him off!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.25,1:28:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.36,1:29:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Now I got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.49,1:29:36.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（有毒废料）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.91,1:30:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.59,1:30:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.89,1:30:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.52,1:30:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.94,1:30:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.99,1:31:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.98,1:31:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.44,1:31:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,克来伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clarence!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.93,1:31:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.64,1:32:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}L give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.26,1:32:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再拘捕你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not arresting you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.35,1:32:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.57,1:32:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.19,1:32:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这件事看成是私人恩怨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking this kind of personal, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.45,1:32:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 你令我很紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Come on, now. You're making me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.99,1:32:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这样做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.70,1:32:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 不要乱来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on now! Don't mess around!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.20,1:32:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.04,1:32:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, now, don't get cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.29,1:32:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 去死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.30,1:32:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.38,1:32:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.55,1:32:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.18,1:32:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,克来伦 我打中他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him, Clarence! I got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.96,1:33:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 机器战警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sayonara, Robocop!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.76,1:33:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.77,1:33:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lewis!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.27,1:33:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲 我很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy, I'm a mess!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.69,1:33:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会把你修好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll fix you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.24,1:33:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们懂得修好一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fix everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.13,1:33:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察罢工对我们有利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police strike could really work for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.09,1:33:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以调派ED209到全市各个角落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the end of the week, we can have Ed 209s in place all over the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.46,1:34:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会马上得到公众支持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and expect immediate public support.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.63,1:34:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就有一个在楼下 守卫着这幢大厦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got one downstairs guarding the building now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.81,1:34:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在私人物业范围非法停车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are illegally parked on private property.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.98,1:34:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有二十秒时间开走你的车辆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have 20 seconds to move your vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.69,1:34:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么事情…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because whatever happens,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.19,1:34:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,本公司都会实践它的指导原则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this corporation will live up to the guiding principles of its founder.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.52,1:35:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇气 力量 定罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courage, strength, conviction.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.99,1:35:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会以同样积极的态度 面对每个新挑战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will meet each new challenge with the same aggressive attitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.20,1:35:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.96,1:35:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.34,1:35:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,警员 我们有何效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we help you, Officer?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.55,1:35:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克·琼斯以谋杀罪被通缉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Jones is wanted for murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.05,1:35:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,荒谬 那东西是个暴力的机械神经汉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is absurd! That thing is a violent mechanical psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.85,1:35:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的程序不容许我对付本公司的人员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My program will not allow me to act against an officer of this company.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.68,1:35:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是严重的指控 你有什么证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are serious charges. What is your evidence?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.95,1:35:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀死罗伯·莫顿 因为他犯了错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to kill Bob Morton because he made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.24,1:35:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是时候消除那个错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's time to erase that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.25,1:35:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀死罗伯·莫顿 因为他犯了错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to kill Bob Morton because he made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.33,1:36:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是时候消除那个错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's time to erase that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.09,1:36:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.63,1:36:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.01,1:36:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上要一架直升机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a chopper. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.59,1:36:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们冷静地步上天台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will walk to the roof very calmly.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.60,1:36:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会连同人质登上直升机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will board the chopper with my hostage.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.43,1:36:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想阻止我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody tries to stop me,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.73,1:36:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个老头就没命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the old geezer gets it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.61,1:36:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克 你被开除了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick, you're fired!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.49,1:36:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.93,1:36:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好身手 你叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shooting, son. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.31,1:37:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨菲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murphy.
